\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Good afternoon,
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 \'a0
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 Please find below trail giving the objectives M&O want to reach over the next years.
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 \'a0
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 In this view, we are required to provide a strategic plan that will be consolidated with other countries in APA and reverted to Alex and HO.
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 \'a0
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 I just received the enclosed framework from Yuan Yuan developed to facilitate the preparation for the regional strategic planning exercise.\'a0 
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 \'a0
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 The ppt is the main document that we need to populate for the strategic planning.\'a0 The excel file serves as a \'93read me first\'94 note.\'a0 It provides explanation on content expectation, suggestion on references as well as the input provider.\'a0 
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 We may reuse or update the relevant input from previous exercises such as the preparation for Jul Ex-com or the Budget 27 exercise as some of the items could be similar.
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 \'a0
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 The framework is built upon the steers from Alex and Jeffrey.\'a0 However, any other ideas or proposals beyond this framework that can help contribute to achieving the 1bn ambition are welcome.
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 \'a0
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 I will book a 2-days workshop/brainstorming in Busan office on 14 and 15 October for us for us to consolidate our strategic plan (attendance is mandatory of course). Thank you to do your homework before those 2 days to be effective during this workshop.
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 \'a0
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 With thanks,
\fs32 \cf4 \strokec4 \

