\f4\b Subject:
\f1\b0  Fw: Together Towards St Emilion (1bn) Ambition: Strategic Planning for the Future of Marine & Offshore
\fs32 \
\'a0\
Dear Team,\
\'a0\
Please find below message from Alex regarding the strategic planning work required to support M&O\'92s \'80/$1bn ambition.\'a0\
\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf4 This is well aligned with the direction I shared during our recent APA Town Hall. For APA, I would like us to use this exercise not simply to document where we are today, but to be clear about where we want to win and what needs to change to get there.\
\'a0\
I have asked Yuanyuan to coordinate the initial\
APA framework. We will then work with each Area and Country to develop the plan bottom-up, while ensuring alignment with our overall APA and M&O priorities.\
\'a0\
In particular, I would like each of you to think about:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f5\fs32 \cf4 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\uc0\u65279 \u65279 
\f1 Where are the biggest realistic growth opportunities in your Area/Country?\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f5 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\uc0\u65279 \u65279 
\f1 Which markets and clients should we prioritize to materially increase our market share?\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f5 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\uc0\u65279 \u65279 
\f1 Are the right clients covered by our current\uc0\u8232 KAM structure, and where are the gaps?\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f5 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\uc0\u65279 \u65279 
\f1 Where are we losing against competitors today, and why?\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f5 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\uc0\u65279 \u65279 
\f1 What capabilities, technical expertise or commercial coverage do we need to strengthen?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf4 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\uc0\u8232 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\fs32 \cf4 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}What organization and resources will be required to deliver the growth?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f5 \cf4 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\uc0\u65279 \u65279 
\f1 What specific actions and milestones can we commit to over the next 3-4 years?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf4 I will arrange discussions with each of you as the initial framework develops. Our APA leadership offsite planned for November will then be an important opportunity to challenge the assumptions, make the necessary choices and align on the final APA strategy before the 1 December deadline.\
\'a0\
Also, as we are currently going through the B27 budget cycle, please keep an open mind on resources. I don't want us to constrain the future plan simply based on today's organization. Where additional people or capabilities are genuinely required to capture growth, build the business case into your planning. At the same time, additional resources need to be supported by clear growth opportunities and expected returns.\
\'a0\
I will review the budget and resource plans with each of you and will challenge both whether we have enough investment for growth and whether the proposed resources are really necessary.\
\'a0\
Please cascade the messages to your leadership team and start the discussion within your respective areas.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf4 \'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
