\f1\b0  Together Towards St Emilion (1bn) Ambition: Strategic Planning for the Future of Marine & Offshore\
\'a0\
Dear Team,\
\'a0\
I hope you have all enjoyed a well-deserved summer break following our EXCOM offsite in Bordeaux and have had the opportunity to spend quality time with your families and return refreshed and energized for the busy months ahead.\
Thank you again for your active participation, engagement, and alignment in Bordeaux. The quality of our discussions reinforced my confidence in our collective ability to deliver on our ambitions, and I am already looking forward to our next offsite in Brussels in December.\
As we discussed in Bordeaux, our vision for Marine & Offshore and our global strategy culminate in our 
\f4\b \'93St. Emilion\'94 (1 billion) ambition
\f1\b0 . Over the summer I have taken the opportunity to review our current position, including market share, orderbook performance, and our strategic account coverage.\
With the support of Steven GROTSKY and his team, who continue to expand our access to market intelligence and enhance our Salesforce capabilities, we now have greater visibility into where we stand today. The latest market share and orderbook data, together with our current KAM list, are attached for your review.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\b \cf4 \'a0
\f1\b0 \

\f4\b Where We Stand
\f1\b0 \
The data provides valuable insights and confirms that achieving our ambition will require us to accelerate beyond our current trajectory. While we have made good progress, our current market share position is not yet aligned with the level required to achieve our long-term objectives. We need to think differently, challenge our current approach, and identify the levers that can enable us to move from approximately 9% market share toward 15%.\
I also noted opportunities to strengthen our KAM coverage. Several important clients are not currently represented, and certain countries are underrepresented or absent altogether. This should form part of our strategic review.\

\f4\b \'a0
\f1\b0 \

\f4\b What We Need To Do
\f1\b0 \
To establish clear priorities and align our resources, I would like us to develop strategic plans at multiple levels:\

\f4\b Regional Strategic Plans
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf4 {\listtext	\'95	}Regional plans, broken down by Area and Country.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Prioritization of target markets, key clients, growth opportunities, and hiring requirements.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Owner: Regional SVPs.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\b \cf4 Head Office & Delegations Strategic Plan
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf4 {\listtext	\'95	}Review of priorities, capabilities, resources, and support required to enable regional success.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Owner: Christophe.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\b \cf4 Advisory Services Strategic Plan
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf4 {\listtext	\'95	}Growth opportunities, service portfolio priorities, resource requirements, and go-to-market approach.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Owner: Jerome.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 This should be both a top-down and bottom-up exercise to ensure alignment between our global strategy and local market realities. I fully expect several iterations as we challenge assumptions and refine priorities.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\b \cf4 Suggested Content
\f1\b0 \
I do not wish to be prescriptive regarding format. My objective is to encourage ownership, engagement, and innovation from your teams. As a minimum, plans should address:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf4 {\listtext	\'95	}Current market landscape and BV M&O market position.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Market share (GT) by country and service line where possible.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Current organization and resources.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Commercial opportunities, target clients, and target markets.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Financial and growth objectives.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Hiring requirements and capability development.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Key milestones and implementation roadmap.\
{\listtext	\'95	}Alignment with our overall M&O strategy and \'801bn ambition.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\b \cf4 \'a0
\f1\b0 \

\f4\b Timeline
\f1\b0 \
I would like the full complete iteration of these plans within the next three months (completion by
\f4\b  1 December
\f1\b0 ), allowing implementation activities to begin in the New Year.\
Please ensure that your B27 planning includes sufficient flexibility for any recruitment or capability investments identified through this process.\

\f4\b \'a0
\f1\b0 \

\f4\b Looking Ahead
\f1\b0 \
I will be holding a Senior Management Town Hall on 
\f4\b 23 September
\f1\b0 , where I intend to reference this strategic planning effort. Please ensure that this message is appropriately cascaded to your leadership teams.\
This is an important opportunity for us to shape the future of Marine & Offshore together. I welcome your ideas, feedback, and early thoughts as we begin this work, and I remain available to support you throughout the process.\
Thank you again for your commitment and leadership.\
\'a0\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa53\partightenfactor0

